    "body": "## What and why\n\nProtected guard roles currently veto finite Prefix/Generate proposals without supplying their own corrective gradient. Add the shared pooled-margin credit boundary needed by the protected-direction successor: explicit winner/rival native log-mass contrast through the same admitted Generate/Copy probability graph as CE. Preserve valid CE behavior and strengthen complete token-table/subtotal admission. No automatic learner objective or serving change.\n\n## Result\n\nKEEP library implementation; protected direction integration and model benefit NOT YET PROMOTED. Native log-mass-ratio forward, CE(rival) minus CE(winner) surrogate Jacobian, physical aliases and clipping preserved. Possible native/relaxed normalization residuals are explicit. Accepted8/512 complete development replies unchanged; no original-parent fit or generated-language evaluation.\n\nExact head `735dc0939fc6bdbbad4e1c5047aa9c0ffcdd911e`: 24 CPU module tests PASS (six new/18 existing), including analytic aliases, non-grid native anchor/CE Jacobians, saturation, legacy CE parity and malformed traces. Exact-head test runtime 2.74s; initial cold build617s/test1.67s, 2 jobs,2.2GiB target. CUDA tests NOT_RUN. No model training/qualification or paid compute.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Exact-head focused tests passed: cargo test -p uor-r4-training --lib geometric_generate_learning::tests --offline (dedicated target; jobs2; dev/test debug0). Changed-file rustfmt and diffcheck PASS. Independent exact-head adversarial review PASS; mathematical surrogate review PASS. Reviewers did not rerun tests.\n- [x] Canonical record docs/labs/protected-margin-credit-2026-10-09/README.md\n- [x] Newest current-state entry ends with Next\n- [x] Claim search inspected; crate README and public API doc comments updated. Historical experiment records retain scope.\n- [x] STATUS/ROADMAP/#2028 unchanged: no accepted artifact or milestone change\n- [x] Root README unchanged: no served mechanism, command or headline result changed\n- [x] python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py PASS\n- [x] Verified fresh main after protected merge; branch and worktree removed; result receipts checksum-verified in iCloud; result posted on M2. Scoped hygiene receipt recorded in the closeout comment.\n\nPackage-wide cargo fmt --package uor-r4-training --check fails on4 untouched parent files (demand-store-2turn.rs, mask-scan.rs, mqar-bench.rs, relation_compiler.rs); full output and unchanged blob receipt retained. No unrelated formatting repair. CI compatibility acknowledgements are not tests.\n\nReferences #2030. Follows #2084 and #2087. Next is runner integration with mechanical protection-role selection, authenticated Prefix incidence and declared finite direction policy before new model work.\n",
